    {
      "Text": "Security update for keybase-client",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for keybase-client fixes the following issues:\n\nChanges in keybase-client:\n\n- CVE-2026-56855,CVE-2026-56854,CVE-2026-78662: authentication bypass and deadlocks in the crypto/ssh library\n  * Add update-go-crypto.patch to update affected dependency (bsc#1278586).\n- Update to go 1.26 as required to update go crypto library\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
